      "locked": false,
      "text": "Abstract method and Abstract class\n=================================\n\nIf there is a method in Parent class which has blank\nbody just for overriding then we can declare that\nmethod as abstract and then we does not need to give\nbody to it.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Abstract method and Abstract class\n=================================\n\nIf there is a method in Parent class which has blank body just for overriding then we can declare that method as abstract and then we does not need to give body to it.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UwhKtQ_ZT1CScCeyJRxWm",
